#: main.ts:131
msgid "AI upscaling needs GPU rendering."
msgstr "AI 超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染。"

#: main.ts:132
msgid "AI upscaling starts when GPU rendering is ready."
msgstr "GPU 渲染就绪后，AI 超分辨率即会生效。"

#. {} is the player's own message, in English.
#: main.ts:136
msgid "AI upscaling needs GPU rendering, which cannot be turned on here: {}"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染，但本机无法开启 GPU 渲染：{}"

#: main.ts:140
msgid "GPU rendering stopped during this run: restart the player to use AI upscaling."
msgstr "GPU 渲染在本次运行中已停止：请重启播放器以使用 AI 超分辨率。"

#: main.ts:141
msgid "GPU rendering is on from the next start: restart the player to use AI upscaling."
msgstr "GPU 渲染将在下次启动时开启：请重启播放器以使用 AI 超分辨率。"

#: main.ts:142
msgid "AI upscaling needs GPU rendering: turn on Video ▸ GPU Rendering (Experimental), then restart the player."
msgstr "AI 超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染：请打开“视频 ▸ GPU 渲染（实验性）”，然后重启播放器。"

#. the first {} is our advice, the second the player's own message, in English.
#: main.ts:155
msgid "{} ({})"
msgstr "{}（{}）"

#: main.ts:160
msgid "AI upscaling is not available on this system. It needs Windows and an NVIDIA RTX GPU."
msgstr "本机无法使用 AI 超分辨率，需要 Windows 和 NVIDIA RTX 显卡。"

#: main.ts:162
msgid "AI upscaling is not available on this computer. It needs an NVIDIA RTX GPU."
msgstr "本机无法使用 AI 超分辨率，需要 NVIDIA RTX 显卡。"

#: main.ts:168
msgid "The player runs on a GPU that cannot upscale: in Windows Settings ▸ System ▸ Display ▸ Graphics, choose the high-performance GPU for Vestra Player, then restart it."
msgstr "播放器正运行在不支持超分辨率的显卡上：请在 Windows 设置 ▸ 系统 ▸ 屏幕 ▸ 显示卡 中为 Vestra Player 选择“高性能”显卡，然后重启播放器。"

#: main.ts:172
msgid "The NVIDIA driver is too old for AI upscaling: update it to version 530 or newer."
msgstr "NVIDIA 驱动版本过旧，无法使用 AI 超分辨率：请更新到 530 或更高版本。"

#: main.ts:174
msgid "AI upscaling is paused while another video filter is active; it comes back when that filter is off."
msgstr "其他视频滤镜生效期间 AI 超分辨率暂停，关闭该滤镜后自动恢复。"

#. {} is the player's own message, in English.
#: main.ts:179
msgid "AI upscaling is not available on this computer: {}"
msgstr "本机无法使用 AI 超分辨率：{}"

#: main.ts:194
msgid "AI upscaling needs Windows and an NVIDIA RTX GPU"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率需要 Windows 和 NVIDIA RTX 显卡"

#: main.ts:196
msgid "AI upscaling needs an NVIDIA RTX GPU"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率需要 NVIDIA RTX 显卡"

#: main.ts:198
msgid "AI upscaling needs NVIDIA driver 530 or newer"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率需要 NVIDIA 驱动 530 或更新版本"

#: main.ts:200
msgid "AI upscaling: choose the NVIDIA GPU in Windows graphics settings"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率：请在 Windows 图形设置中选择 NVIDIA 显卡"

#: main.ts:202
msgid "AI upscaling paused while another video filter is on"
msgstr "其他视频滤镜开启时，AI 超分辨率暂停"

#: main.ts:205
msgid "AI upscaling needs GPU rendering"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染"

#: main.ts:206
msgid "AI upscaling starts when GPU rendering is ready"
msgstr "GPU 渲染就绪后，AI 超分辨率即生效"

#: main.ts:207
msgid "AI upscaling needs GPU rendering, unavailable here"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染，但本机无法开启"

#: main.ts:209
msgid "Restart the player to use AI upscaling"
msgstr "重启播放器以使用 AI 超分辨率"

#: main.ts:210
msgid "AI upscaling: turn on Video ▸ GPU Rendering, then restart"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率：请打开“视频 ▸ GPU 渲染”并重启"

#: main.ts:213
msgid "AI upscaling is not available here (details in the Video menu)"
msgstr "本机无法使用 AI 超分辨率（详见视频菜单）"

#: main.ts:234
msgid "AI Upscaling: On — also turn on Super Resolution in the NVIDIA app"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率：开——还需在 NVIDIA App 中打开超分辨率"

#: main.ts:263
msgid "AI Upscaling: On, waits until other video filters are off"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率：开，其他视频滤镜关闭后生效"

#: main.ts:265
msgid "AI Upscaling: On, starts when GPU rendering is ready"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率：开，GPU 渲染就绪后生效"

#: main.ts:267
msgid "AI Upscaling: On"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率：开"

#: main.ts:281
msgid "AI Upscaling: Off"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率：关"

#: main.ts:340
msgid "AI Upscaling (RTX Video Super Resolution)"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率（RTX 视频超分辨率）"

#: manifest.json
msgid "VestraUpscale"
msgstr "VestraUpscale"

#: manifest.json
msgid "AI upscaling of the video with NVIDIA RTX Video Super Resolution"
msgstr "用 NVIDIA RTX 视频超分辨率对视频做 AI 放大"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Adds Video ▸ AI Upscaling (RTX Video Super Resolution): the NVIDIA GPU sharpens and enlarges the video to the size it is shown at. Needs Windows, an NVIDIA RTX GPU, GPU rendering and Super Resolution turned on in the NVIDIA app. On macOS and Linux the item is greyed out from the start; on Windows it is greyed out with the reason once the player has checked the GPU. Remembers your choice."
msgstr "添加“视频 ▸ AI 超分辨率（RTX 视频超分辨率）”：由 NVIDIA 显卡将视频锐化并放大到显示尺寸。需要 Windows、NVIDIA RTX 显卡、GPU 渲染，并在 NVIDIA App 中打开“超分辨率”。在 macOS 和 Linux 上该菜单项一开始就是灰色；在 Windows 上，播放器检查显卡后如无法使用，菜单项变灰并显示原因。会记住你的选择。"

#: manifest.json
msgid "video"
msgstr "视频"

#: manifest.json
msgid "upscaling"
msgstr "超分辨率"

#: manifest.json
msgid "NVIDIA"
msgstr "NVIDIA"
